---
const deckShots = [
  { src: '/images/weaverdeck-ide.jpg', alt: 'C++ source open in WeaverDeck IDE with its phone programming keyboard', label: '01 / Code on the phone' },
  { src: '/images/weaverdeck-notes.jpg', alt: 'Linked local notes in WeaverDeck', label: '02 / Keep project context' },
  { src: '/images/weaverdeck-git.jpg', alt: 'Git diff for a C++ project in WeaverDeck', label: '03 / Review the diff' },
  { src: '/images/weaverdeck-remote.jpg', alt: 'Remote View streaming a desktop window to the phone', label: '04 / See a running window' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#e9e8e1" />
    <meta name="description" content="WeaverDeck is a phone-first developer tool for reaching your own PC: terminal, IDE, Git, notes, and Remote View from iPhone Safari." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Danijel — Building WeaverDeck" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A phone-first command center for a developer PC." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://skicmi.github.io/images/danijel-persona.webp" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500;6..72,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>Danijel — Building WeaverDeck</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Danijel home"><span class="mark">D<span>·</span></span><span>DANIJEL</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#work">Selected work <span>01</span></a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
      <span class="availability"><i></i> INDEPENDENT BUILDER</span>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero persona-hero" id="top">
        <div class="persona-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> DIGITAL ALTER EGO / PROFILE 001</p>
          <h1>Meet the <em>builder.</em></h1>
          <p>This hooded character is my fictional identity — a visual stand-in for the side of me that makes things.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-stage">
          <aside class="identity-note note-left">
            <span class="note-index">01 / THE PERSONA</span>
            <h2>A face for<br />the work.</h2>
            <p>Not a real portrait. This is my “fake ID” for the maker behind WeaverDeck.</p>
            <div class="note-mark">D<span>·</span></div>
          </aside>
          <article class="identity-card" aria-label="Danijel's fictional developer persona card">
            <div class="id-top"><span>WEAVER / IDENTITY FILE</span><span>WD—001</span></div>
            <div class="id-portrait"><img src="/images/danijel-persona.webp" alt="Hooded fictional developer avatar with glowing orange eyes holding a C++ book" /></div>
            <div class="id-name-row"><div><span class="id-label">DIGITAL PERSONA</span><h2>DANIJEL</h2></div><div class="id-stamp">FICTIONAL<br />AVATAR</div></div>
            <div class="id-fields"><div><span>ROLE</span><b>SOFTWARE BUILDER</b></div><div><span>KNOWN FOR</span><b>WEAVERDECK</b></div></div>
          </article>
          <aside class="identity-note note-right">
            <span class="note-index">02 / THE REAL WORK</span>
            <h2>WeaverDeck</h2>
            <p>A phone-first companion for reaching my own PC when a coding task needs my input.</p>
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#work">See the project <span>↓</span></a>
            <div class="note-coordinates">TERMINAL · IDE · REMOTE VIEW</div>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-foot"><span>FICTIONAL AVATAR · REAL SOFTWARE</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div>
      </section>

      <figure class="persona-interlude">
        <img src="/images/persona-reading.webp" alt="Danijel's hooded fictional avatar relaxing with an open C++ book and handwritten notes" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption><span>FIELD NOTES / 001</span><b>Ideas take shape<br />between builds.</b></figcaption>
        <span class="scene-coordinate">THE MAKER, OFF THE CLOCK</span>
      </figure>

      <section class="work-section" id="work">
        <div class="section-heading wrap">
          <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> ONE PROJECT · BUILT FROM A REAL WORKFLOW</p><h2>Selected work<span class="count">01</span></h2></div>
          <p class="section-aside">One project, built around a real workflow.<br />More detail than a wall of project cards.</p>
        </div>

        <article class="featured-project wrap">
          <div class="project-topline"><span>01 / FLAGSHIP PROJECT</span><span class="project-status"><i></i> PAID EARLY ACCESS</span></div>
          <div class="project-main">
            <div class="project-copy">
              <p class="project-kind">DEVELOPER TOOL · PERSONAL PRODUCT</p>
              <h3>Weaver<span>Deck</span></h3>
              <p class="project-description">A remote command center for your own development PC. When work needs your input, WeaverDeck brings the terminal, IDE, Git, local notes, and Remote View to iPhone Safari.</p>
              <div class="problem-note"><span class="note-symbol">↳</span><p><b>The idea</b><br />AI-assisted coding still pauses for commands and decisions. I wanted to step in from my phone and let work continue on the PC.</p></div>
              <ul class="tech-list" aria-label="Technologies used"><li>TypeScript</li><li>React</li><li>Node.js</li><li>WebSockets</li></ul>
              <div class="project-links"><a href="https://github.com/SkicMi/WeaverDeck" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the repository <span>↗</span></a><a href="https://www.patreon.com/Weaverpp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Check Patreon <span>↗</span></a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-frame">
              <div class="demo-bar"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>WEAVERDECK — PRODUCT WALKTHROUGH</span><span>00:45</span></div>
              <video controls preload="none" poster="/images/weaverdeck-poster.jpg" playsinline aria-label="WeaverDeck narrated product demo">
                <source src="/video/weaverdeck-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href="/video/weaverdeck-demo.mp4">Open the demo.</a>
              </video>
              <p class="demo-caption">Demo recorded from a local development build with sample data. Remote View shows a simulated desktop window.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-strip"><span>TERMINAL / IDE / NOTES / GIT / REMOTE VIEW</span><span>WINDOWS + LINUX PC · IPHONE SAFARI</span></div>
        </article>

        <figure class="persona-interlude persona-work-scene">
          <img src="/images/persona-coding.webp" alt="Danijel's hooded fictional avatar working on a laptop with code floating nearby" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><span>AT THE DESK / 002</span><b>Built from the<br />work I actually do.</b></figcaption>
          <span class="scene-coordinate">WEAVERDECK · MADE FOR MY OWN WORKFLOW</span>
        </figure>


        <section class="gallery-section wrap" aria-labelledby="gallery-title">
          <div class="gallery-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> INSIDE WEAVERDECK</p><h3 id="gallery-title">One phone. Your PC.</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/SkicMi/WeaverDeck" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">More in the repository ↗</a></div>
          <div class="shot-grid">{deckShots.map((shot) => <figure class="shot"><img src={shot.src} alt={shot.alt} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{shot.label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section" id="about">
        <div class="about-layout wrap">
          <div class="about-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h2>Build it.<br /><em>Understand it.</em><br />Make it useful.</h2></div>
          <div class="about-copy"><p class="about-lead">I’m Danijel, a Software Engineering student at Algebra. I work with C++, AI technologies, and web development. WeaverDeck grew out of a friction I kept hitting: a coding task on my PC needed my input while I was away from the desk.</p><p>I wanted to reach the terminal and desktop from my phone, answer the prompt myself, and carry on. I build WeaverDeck in small iterations, guided by how it feels in actual use: a phone-sized IDE, useful coding keys, and remote controls that stay responsive.</p><div class="toolbox"><span>THINGS I WORK WITH</span><div><b>C++</b><b>AI technologies</b><b>Web development</b><b>TypeScript</b><b>React</b><b>Node.js</b><b>WebSockets</b><b>Vite</b><b>Tailscale</b></div></div><a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/SkicMi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Find me on GitHub <span>↗</span></a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section wrap" id="contact"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> OPEN TAB</p><div class="contact-main"><h2>Have a good<br /><em>problem to solve?</em></h2><a class="contact-button" href="https://github.com/SkicMi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Contact Danijel through GitHub">Say hello on GitHub <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer wrap"><a class="wordmark" href="#top"><span class="mark">D<span>·</span></span><span>DANIJEL</span></a><span>BUILT WITH CURIOSITY · DEPLOYED WITH GITHUB PAGES</span><a href="#top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a><span>© 2026</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
:root{--paper:#e9e8e1;--paper2:#f2f1eb;--ink:#1d211d;--muted:#70766f;--line:#c9cbc1;--green:#b5ec78;--green-dark:#466c33;--forest:#18221b;--forest2:#24362a;--white:#f3f5ef;--mono:'DM Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;--sans:'Manrope',system-ui,sans-serif;--serif:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:80px}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}img,video{max-width:100%;display:block}::selection{background:var(--green);color:var(--ink)}.wrap{width:min(1320px,calc(100% - 96px));margin-inline:auto}.topbar{height:78px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 48px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(233,232,225,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}.wordmark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font:500 13px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.mark{width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid var(--ink);display:grid;place-content:center;font:600 14px var(--sans);letter-spacing:0}.mark span{color:var(--green-dark)}.topbar nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.topbar nav a{transition:color .2s}.topbar nav a:hover,.text-link:hover,.project-links a:hover{color:var(--green-dark)}.topbar nav span{font:10px var(--mono);color:var(--muted);padding-left:4px}.topbar nav .arrow{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink)}.availability{font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.availability i,.project-status i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#72a94e;display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #72a94e22}
.hero{min-height:620px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .9fr;grid-template-rows:1fr auto;align-items:center;position:relative;padding-top:50px}.hero-copy{padding:30px 0 60px;position:relative;z-index:1}.eyebrow{font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 25px}.eyebrow-line{width:25px;height:1px;background:var(--green-dark);display:inline-block}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,100px);line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0 0 25px;font-weight:600}.hero h1 em,.about-heading em,.next-card h3 em,.contact-main em{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.06em}.intro{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;max-width:460px;color:#545b53;margin:0}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;margin-top:31px}.button{height:48px;padding:0 19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;transition:transform .2s,background .2s}.button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.button-dark{background:var(--ink);color:var(--white)}.button-dark:hover{background:var(--green-dark)}.text-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px}.text-link span{margin-left:6px}.hero-art{height:430px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#dfe3d8;border:1px solid #c7cec1;isolation:isolate}.art-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(#9aa99233 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#9aa99233 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px;mask-image:linear-gradient(120deg,black,transparent 90%)}.orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid #6d8d6677;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-25deg)}.orbit-one{width:500px;height:210px;left:3%;top:24%}.orbit-two{width:420px;height:300px;left:15%;top:17%;transform:rotate(53deg)}.core{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:165px;height:165px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;background:var(--forest);color:var(--white);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 25px 55px #19271c55}.core span{font:10px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.15em;color:#c8d1c2}.core b{font:34px var(--serif);font-weight:400;color:var(--green)}.art-chip{position:absolute;z-index:1;background:var(--paper2);border:1px solid #b8c3b1;padding:9px 11px;font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.05em;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 #1d211d17}.chip-a{left:9%;top:22%}.chip-b{right:8%;top:35%}.chip-c{left:21%;bottom:18%}.art-cross{position:absolute;right:24%;bottom:14%;font-size:45px;color:#719463}.art-index{position:absolute;bottom:15px;right:15px;font:9px var(--mono);color:#697566}.hero-foot{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:15px 0 18px;font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--muted)}
.work-section{background:var(--paper2);padding:92px 0 100px;border-top:1px solid #d9dad2}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:34px}.section-heading h2,.about-heading h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,70px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:1;margin:0;font-weight:600}.count{font:12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:0;color:var(--green-dark);vertical-align:top;margin-left:12px}.section-aside{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 3px}.featured-project{background:var(--forest);color:var(--white);padding:22px 28px 0}.project-topline,.feature-strip{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;color:#abb8a9}.project-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#c9eaba}.project-main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;padding:40px 0 36px;align-items:center}.project-copy{padding:0 0 7px 9px}.project-kind{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#9daf97;margin:0 0 12px}.project-copy h3{font:600 clamp(40px,5.2vw,68px)/.95 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0 0 18px}.project-copy h3 span{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;color:var(--green);font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-.06em}.project-description{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#c8d0c5;margin:0;max-width:435px}.problem-note{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:20px;padding:14px 15px;border-left:2px solid var(--green);background:#ffffff08;max-width:450px}.problem-note .note-symbol{font:20px var(--mono);color:var(--green)}.problem-note p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#c7d0c5;margin:0}.problem-note b{color:#f0f4ed}.tech-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;list-style:none;margin:20px 0;padding:0}.tech-list li{border:1px solid #526256;border-radius:2px;padding:5px 8px;font:9px var(--mono);color:#c4d0c0}.project-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 24px}.project-links a,.card-link{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#dbefcf}.project-links a span,.card-link span{margin-left:7px;color:var(--green)}.demo-frame{background:#0a100c;border:1px solid #465449;box-shadow:0 20px 50px #0003}.demo-bar{height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 11px;border-bottom:1px solid #314033;font:8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.07em;color:#91a18e}.demo-bar>span:first-child{display:flex;gap:4px}.demo-bar i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#748071}.demo-frame video{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;background:#070c08}.demo-caption{font:9px/1.5 var(--mono);color:#a8b4a5;margin:0;padding:9px 11px;border-top:1px solid #314033}.feature-strip{border-top:1px solid #405244;padding:15px 0;color:#aebba9;font-size:8px}.project-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:22px;margin-top:22px}.project-card,.next-card{border:1px solid #d1d4ca;background:var(--paper);min-height:340px}.card-art{height:183px;background:#17251c;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background-image:linear-gradient(#9bb68b1c 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#9bb68b1c 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:24px 24px}.card-art:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:10%;top:54%;width:80%;height:1px;background:#84be6455;transform:rotate(-17deg)}.card-art:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:15%;width:1px;height:75%;background:#84be6455}.particle{position:absolute;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#c0f17c;box-shadow:0 0 13px 4px #9fe5605c;animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate}.p1{left:20%;top:67%}.p2{left:29%;top:49%;animation-delay:-1s}.p3{left:38%;top:59%;animation-delay:-2s}.p4{left:43%;top:40%;animation-delay:-1.5s}.p5{left:51%;top:47%;animation-delay:-.5s}.p6{left:58%;top:30%;animation-delay:-2.4s}.p7{left:63%;top:57%;animation-delay:-.8s}.p8{left:70%;top:44%;animation-delay:-1.3s}.p9{left:76%;top:36%;animation-delay:-2s}.p10{left:47%;top:76%;animation-delay:-.2s}.p11{left:34%;top:28%;animation-delay:-1.2s}.p12{left:83%;top:60%;animation-delay:-.7s}.axis-x,.axis-y{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;background:#b5ec78}.axis-x{height:1px;width:80px;transform:rotate(-20deg)}.axis-y{width:1px;height:75px;transform:rotate(10deg)}.card-art-label{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:12px;font:8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#a5b39e}.card-body{padding:20px 22px 22px}.card-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:8px var(--mono);color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.07em}.card-body h3{font:600 30px var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:15px 0 8px}.card-body p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#5e665d;max-width:520px;margin:0 0 18px}.card-link{color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block}.card-link span{color:var(--green-dark)}.next-card{padding:23px 26px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#dfe4d8}.next-card .eyebrow{margin-bottom:13px}.next-glyph{font:130px/.9 var(--serif);color:#557348;position:absolute;right:28px;top:41px;opacity:.24;transform:rotate(-20deg)}.next-card h3{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.98;margin:23px 0 14px;font-weight:600;position:relative}.next-card p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#596254;max-width:360px}.next-foot{position:absolute;bottom:20px;font:8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;color:#6e796a}.gallery-section{padding-top:90px}.gallery-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px}.gallery-heading .eyebrow{margin-bottom:11px}.gallery-heading h3{font-size:31px;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.shot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.shot{margin:0;background:var(--forest);padding:10px 10px 12px;color:var(--white)}.shot img{width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;background:#0b130e}.shot figcaption{font:8px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.04em;color:#c7d2c3;margin:10px 2px 0}
